# INSTRUCTIONS - read before you save as nas-client-token.txt
#
# The file nas-client-token.txt must contain ONLY the token value on its own line.
# Do NOT put the token inside a # comment line - comments are skipped and the next line is used.
# Wrong:  # my token is abc123...   (worker would use "REPLACE..." placeholder if left below)
# Right:  one line, no quotes, no spaces, matching ECS backend/.env NAS_CLIENT_TOKEN:
#
# REPLACE_WITH_SAME_TOKEN_AS_ECS
#
# Copy a real token into nas-client-token.txt as the ONLY line, OR as first non-# line.
# Never commit nas-client-token.txt (gitignored).
